 community by trading his bananas for goods. When gangsters arrive with plans to construct a banana processing plant, Joe kicks them out, but the mob boss discovers that Joe is operating without a license. After the mob tips off the authorities and Joe's boat is impounded, he ventures into a big city for the first time to seek help."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fq4nmihNSiTGpuA09kmIZWSsU0h.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fq4nmihNSiTGpuA09kmIZWSsU0h.png","language":"it","width":1896,"height":756},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4dGzyhCRYkb6a28kY8czaJwB6UY.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4dGzyhCRYkb6a28kY8czaJwB6UY.png","language":"en","width":739,"height":302},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7kvGt0eMbCP7Vd6j6cjcgqkA69f.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7kvGt0eMbCP7Vd6j6cjcgqkA69f.png","language":"en","width":739,"height":302},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/chd2VK8UHcj94DiEzrHuWUhrkRH.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/chd2VK8UHcj94DiEzrHuWUhrkRH.png","language":"en","width":800,"height":310}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jwGmvZT2TzYQvzyDDnyUC1y8uQ2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jwGmvZT2TzYQvzyDDnyUC1y8uQ2.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mW1gLzsxXbkmUYO35L4vehPNEKb.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mW1gLzsxXbkmUYO35L4vehPNEKb.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8XtEy9EHPoSpjcRPUD8Wy9XKQjm.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8XtEy9EHPoSpjcRPUD8Wy9XKQjm.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kNWbOXZdOTPqBD5J0g9AYQl8C4p.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/